                                                "sense_id": "2b35bdae-3950-3420-9d2e-7ec1a0fb0df1",
                                                "text": "At laſt, the Phyſicians, after a long and ſtormie voyage, ſee land; They haue ſo good ſignes of the concoction of the diſeaſe, as that they may ſafely proceed to purge."
